Compiler for Wardscript, a typed language for trustworthy AI functions and agents

Usage: ward <COMMAND>

Commands:
  check  Type-check a program and report diagnostics
  build  Compile a program to a target language
  run    Build a program and call one of its functions
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
